        target=[di+0x97], proj=si, firer=di).
  9b5c (0x9b5c): muzzle-fx spawn -- si=b1d6(0x12,di) (return was dropped), 9b6f(new,firer).
  9b6f (0x9b6f): muzzle-fx position init -- copy firer X/Y/Z, offset by 03a9(aim); every WORD/DWORD field
        was int*-scaled by Ghidra.
RESULT: crash-clean, projectiles SPAWN + FLY (a294 120->150).  Remaining (next): projectiles accumulate to
the pool cap (don't despawn/hit) -> no damage yet; that is the projectile collision/despawn path.
